==English==
{{wp|+ (surname)}}
{{swp|+, West Virginia}}

===Etymology 1===
* As an English surname, from the adjective {{m|en|good}}.
* Also as an English surname, from the personal name {{m|en|Gōde}}, which represents the first part of names such as {{m|en|Godfrey}}, {{m|en|Gottfried}}, etc.
* As a {{der|en|de|-}} surname, Americanized from {{m|en|Gut}}, {{m|en|Guth}}.
* As a {{der|en|nl|-}} surname, Americanized from {{m|en|Goed}}, {{m|en|Goede}}.

====Alternative forms====
* {{l|en|Goode}}

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|en|/ɡʊd/}}

====Proper noun====
{{en-prop}}

# {{surname|en}}.
