# {{place|en|ucomm|co/Hampshire County|s/West Virginia}}.

===Etymology 2===
{{wp|Form of the +}}
{{ellipsis|en|[[the]] [[form]] [[of]] the Good}}, a {{calque|en|grc|[[ἡ]] [[τοῦ]] [[ἀγαθοῦ]] [[ἰδέα]]|nocap=1}}, a concept used in {{w|Plato}}'s ''{{w|Republic (Plato)|Republic}}''.

====Proper noun====
{{en-prop|head=the Good}}

# {{lb|en|philosophy}} {{w|Plato}}'s [[metaprinciple]] of [[proper]] [[systemic]] [[function]] between [[principle]]s; the [[fundamental]] [[Platonic]] [[form]] which [[enable]]s [[knowledge]] and [[metacognition]], from which other [[concept]]s such as [[truth]], [[justice]] and [[virtue]] derive [[meaning]].

{{C|en|Platonism}}
